-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"たまたま、ヴァチカンから訪日していた、バテレン東方師団の構成員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"とある事情から帰国の途につきそびれ、本国に帰国するために、紋十郎の命を狙う。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールそうな外見とはうらはらに、実はかなりドジッ娘。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔導書を手に四大元素の魔術を操る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「神の御名と精霊の加護によって、風よ、吹雪け！　雷よ、轟けッ！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1044","sourceWorkId":"18309","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ヴァチカンから訪日していたバテレン東方師団の構成員。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"魔導書を手に四大元素の魔術を操る。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本国に帰国するために、紋十郎の命を狙う。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"66628"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7e/7eb48fc043626a6d3fc43ae93d6c942a9245c03efb8915c1e4a59961652c1c81.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/fc/fc0048ee8893c86e458cbab0bccfae11c5eb7d5fecff84e512cea439dea25b67.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[]},{"characterId":"char_c63883","characterName":"神楽坂 小十郎太","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"66626","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"80312"}],"egsCharacterIds":["1041"],"vndbCharacterId":"c63883"},"originalCharacterName":"神楽坂 小十郎太","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"神楽坂政親の忘れ形見。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父の仇を討つべく、紋十郎を追う若き大津塚の国主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まだ元服前だが、紋十郎とは旧知の仲。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その恵まれた生まれと容姿を紋十郎は常に妬んでいたが、実は……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛刀は神楽坂家の宝剣、オサフネ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「フッ…… 今宵の月が見納めだな、紋十郎ッ！」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1041","sourceWorkId":"18309","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"神楽坂政親の忘れ形見。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"父の仇を討つべく、紋十郎を追う若き大津塚の国主。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"まだ元服前だが、紋十郎とは旧知の仲。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"その恵まれた生まれと容姿を紋十郎は常に妬んでいたが、実は……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"愛刀は神楽坂家の宝剣、オサフネ。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"66626"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{"sex":[{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c63883","value":"f"},{"comparisonValue":"m","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1041","value":"男性"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"1041","value":"女性"},{"comparisonValue":"f","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"66626","value":"女"}]},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/86/86b677299ef4b46c84a2261a8250d8ba6137626b8a426692a00c334a107a4183.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6b/6b82758eeff741610211be91545773a9eb3f26f809561b3f23dfa619bace6797.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"天乙准花","creatorId":"vndb:s339","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s339","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s339","name":"椎那 天","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:80312:66626:7890:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c63884","characterName":"三好晴海入道","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[],"egsCharacterIds":["1046"],"vndbCharacterId":"c63884"},"originalCharacterName":"三好晴海入道","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"京の六宗総本山「六波羅」より、緋天の巻物 の奪還を命じられた怪力の尼僧。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"般若湯 （酒） をあおり、童貞喰いが趣味の淫乱破戒僧。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"左腕には一面包帯が巻かれており、生身の腕を見た者は誰もいない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ちなみに、真田十勇士に登場する同名の人物とは縁もゆかりもない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「菩薩も閻魔も今更、手ぇなんざ出せないの